OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals sign charter to keep
OL,4,Awomen and girls safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two hospitals in Northampton and
OL,7,FKettering have joined 119 other local
OL,8,Forganisations that have signed up to
OL,9,Fthe Northamptonshire Women's Charter.
OL,11,FThe charter was launched more than nine
OL,12,Fmonths ago by Danielle Stone, the
OL,13,Fpolice, fire and crime commissioner for
OL,14,Fthe county.
OL,16,FBy joining, the hospitals have
OL,17,Fcommitted to improving the safety of
OL,18,Fwomen and girls at work and in public
OL,19,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
