OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals sign charter to keep
OL,4,Awomen and girls safe
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaula Kirkpatrick, University Hospitals
OL,7,Fof Northamptonshire's chief people
OL,8,Fofficer, said: "Signing this Charter is
OL,9,Fimportant to UHN. We want to make sure
OL,10,Fall women and girls who work in our
OL,11,Fhospitals or who use our services can
OL,12,Fdo so without fear of violence."
